			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1208,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): Remove file event stub overrides that silenced real Vine events\n\nSix stub file lifecycle event handlers (`onWillCreateFiles`, `onWillDeleteFiles`, `onWillRenameFiles`, `onDidCreateFiles`, `onDidDeleteFiles`, `onDidRenameFiles`) on the Workspace namespace were returning no-op disposables, overriding the real `EventSubscriber` implementations already provided by the spread of `BuildDocumentEventMembers` into the workspace object.\n\nExtensions subscribing to these events — including GitLens and similar file-system-aware extensions — were silently receiving dead handlers that emitted nothing. Remove the stubs so the live events flow through. Mountain now fires `willCreate`/`willDelete`/`willRename` notifications to Cocoon via Vine before the VFS mutation lands on disk, giving watchers correct pre-mutation signal.",
			"SHA": "a44ce732e7fee7aa9f09c22146df31eedab6301f"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-22T10:30:33Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1208,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): Reorder bootstrap stages so RPCServer binds before MountainConnection\n\nThe Stage 3 MountainConnection gRPC probe previously ran ahead of Stage 5 RPCServer in the bootstrap pipeline. This meant Mountain's 20-second gRPC retry budget saw port 50052 unbound on every attempt — the server never started within the connect window, causing persistent bootstrap failures.\n\nSwap the execution order in `makeBootstrap` so RPCServer binds port 50052 first, then MountainConnection's gRPC client connects to a live listener. With the ordering fixed, reduce retry caps proportionally: TCP probe drops from 10 to 3 attempts (300ms timeout, 100ms gap → ~1.2s worst case), gRPC connect from 15 to 5 attempts (500ms backoff → ~7.5s worst case). The old aggressive caps were papering over the sequencing bug.\n\nUpdate all related inline documentation to reflect the new stage ordering and rationale.",
			"SHA": "4eaa3135556e509319e9b956145bb6272007202e"
		}
	],
	"TimeStamp": 1781194538300
}